[
  {
    "uuid": "e08e5f68-2972-569a-a5fd-3bbd38de004d",
    "entry": "打ち止める",
    "reading": {
      "primary": "うちとめる",
      "alternatives": [],
      "is_heteronym": false
    },
    "grammar": {
      "pos": [
        "動詞-一段",
        "動詞-他動詞"
      ],
      "ctype": "一段",
      "inflections": null,
      "ctype_source": "pos-derived",
      "ctype_confidence": "high"
    },
    "definitions": [
      {
        "index": 1,
        "gloss": "to hammer into place",
        "register": "standard",
        "nuance": null,
        "scenarios": [],
        "sensory_tags": {
          "colors": [],
          "temperature": null,
          "sounds": [],
          "emotions": []
        },
        "collocations": [],
        "examples": {
          "standard": [
            {
              "text": "浮いていた床板を釘でしっかりと打ち止める。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3-flash-preview"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "手すりの緩みを直すため、金具をボルトで打ち止めた。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3-flash-preview"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "柵が倒れないように、補強用の添え木を打ち止めておく。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3-flash-preview"
              }
            }
          ],
          "literary": [
            {
              "text": "どんな飛んでいる鳥も、走っているうさぎも、またくまや、おおかみのような猛獣も、たいてい的をつけたものは、そらさず一｜発で打ち止めるというほど上手でありました。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "おおかみと人",
                "author": "小川未明",
                "note": "青空文庫"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "そしてブリキ板を細い帯状に切り、木の底部の縁とズックの被包面との継ぎ目を縫糸の代りに鋲でトントン打ち止めるのである。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "忘れ残りの記",
                "author": "――四半自叙伝――",
                "note": "青空文庫"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "他巳吉は例年の習慣通りに、この町の目ぼしい社を一巡して、白山神社で打ちとめると、左門のもとへ立寄つた。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "吹雪物語",
                "author": "――夢と知性――",
                "note": "青空文庫"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "怪しい奴なら、ただ一発のもとに撃ちとめるつもりだ。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "幽霊船の秘密",
                "author": "海野十三",
                "note": "青空文庫"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "index": 2,
        "gloss": "to end (a performance)",
        "register": "standard",
        "nuance": null,
        "scenarios": [],
        "sensory_tags": {
          "colors": [],
          "temperature": null,
          "sounds": [],
          "emotions": []
        },
        "collocations": [],
        "examples": {
          "standard": [
            {
              "text": "予定されていた全ての演目が終了し、三番太鼓を鳴らして興行を打ち止める。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3-flash-preview"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "今日の芝居はこれにて打ち止め、また明日のご来場をお待ちしております。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3-flash-preview"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "長い演奏の最後を力強い一撃で打ち止める。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3-flash-preview"
              }
            }
          ],
          "literary": []
        }
      },
      {
        "index": 3,
        "gloss": "to kill (with a gun, sword, etc.)",
        "register": "standard",
        "nuance": null,
        "scenarios": [],
        "sensory_tags": {
          "colors": [],
          "temperature": null,
          "sounds": [],
          "emotions": []
        },
        "collocations": [],
        "examples": {
          "standard": [
            {
              "text": "襲いかかってくる猛獣を、猟銃の一撃で打ち止めた。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3-flash-preview"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "武士は迫り来る刺客を、一刀のもとに打ち止める。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3-flash-preview"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "敵の首領を打ち止め、ようやく戦いに終止符を打った。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3-flash-preview"
              }
            }
          ],
          "literary": []
        }
      }
    ],
