  {
    "uuid": "032de3e8-3d0d-549d-9287-fab4884c7887",
    "entry": "撃ち止める",
    "reading": {
      "primary": "うちとめる",
      "alternatives": [],
      "is_heteronym": false
    },
    "grammar": {
      "pos": [
        "動詞-一段",
        "動詞-他動詞"
      ],
      "ctype": "一段",
      "inflections": null,
      "ctype_source": "pos-derived",
      "ctype_confidence": "high"
    },
    "definitions": [
      {
        "index": 1,
        "gloss": "to shoot dead",
        "register": "standard",
        "nuance": null,
        "scenarios": [],
        "sensory_tags": {
          "colors": [],
          "temperature": null,
          "sounds": [],
          "emotions": []
        },
        "collocations": [],
        "examples": {
          "standard": [
            {
              "text": "狙撃手は見事な腕前で、逃走する犯人を撃ち止めた。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3-flash-preview"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "畑を荒らす害獣を追い詰め、猟銃で撃ち止める。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3-flash-preview"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "銃弾を命中させて、空飛ぶ鳥を撃ち止める。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3-flash-preview"
              }
            }
          ],
          "literary": [
            {
              "text": "この頬をと思ったら、一発で撃ち止めるか、さもなくば、手出しはしないことだ。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "にんじん",
                "author": "POIL DE CAROTTE",
                "note": "青空文庫"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "それはそうと、若い狩猟家の名声が決まるのは、鴫を一羽撃ち止めるということだ。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "にんじん",
                "author": "POIL DE CAROTTE",
                "note": "青空文庫"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "また、宝鹿は四月、五月の間は自分の頭の血角をよく保護するためにそんなに遠いところに遊びに出ないけれども、土人は巧みにこの血角宝鹿を撃ち止めるです。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "チベット旅行記",
                "author": "河口慧海",
                "note": "青空文庫"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    ],
    "relations": {
